       </table></ix:nonNumeric></div><p style="text-indent:4.533%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">As noted in </span><a href="#note_1_business_acct_policies"><span style="color:#0000ff;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Note 1: Description of Business and Summary of Significant Accounting Policies</span></a><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">, the Company adopted ASU 2023-09 on a prospective-basis for the year ended December 31, 2025. </span><span><ix:nonNumeric id="F_89af6d18-b86e-43eb-8533-9ab182b77403" contextRef="C_800b6764-1697-490f-9880-017960f87821" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfEffectiveIncomeTaxRateReconciliationTableTextBlock" escape="true" continuedAt="F_89af6d18-b86e-43eb-8533-9ab182b77403_1"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">The Company's income tax expense differed from the amounts computed by applying the U.S. federal statutory rate to the loss before the provision for income taxes in accordance with ASU 2023-09 for the following items:</span></ix:nonNumeric></span></p><div><ix:continuation id="F_89af6d18-b86e-43eb-8533-9ab182b77403_1" continuedAt="F_89af6d18-b86e-43eb-8533-9ab182b77403_2">
       <table style="margin-left:auto;border-spacing:0;table-layout:auto;width:100.0%;border-collapse:separate;margin-right:auto;">
        <tr style="visibility:collapse;">
         <td style="width:66.993%;box-sizing:content-box;"/>
         <td style="width:1.62%;box-sizing:content-box;"/>
         <td style="width:1%;box-sizing:content-box;"/>
         <td style="width:12.883000000000001%;box-sizing:content-box;"/>
